s/faq","source_title":"Historic Ohio State: FAQ","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Performed at a range of university events; access depends on the host event.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-oh-io-chant","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"O-H-I-O Chant","title":"O-H-I-O Chant","subtitle":"Call-and-response rallying cry","notes":"When someone calls “O-H,” answer “I-O”; it is a concise call-and-response tradition documented by the university.","short_summary":"A two-part Buckeye chant used across the Ohio State community.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State Undergraduate Admissions identifies the O-H I-O chant as a rallying cry for Buckeyes everywhere.","source_url":"https://undergrad.osu.edu/life-on-campus/spirit-and-tradition","source_title":"Spirit and tradition | The Ohio State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Can be used in ordinary public settings while respecting the setting and those nearby.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-hang-on-sloopy","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Hang On Sloopy","title":"Hang On Sloopy","subtitle":"Ohio Stadium second-half tradition","notes":"Listen for the band’s rendition during the second half of a home game; current timing may vary with game-day programming.","short_summary":"A song adopted by Ohio State’s marching band and retained in stadium tradition.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State’s 2025 athletics announcement states that Hang On Sloopy remains an Ohio Stadium tradition, while allowing flexible second-half timing.","source_url":"https://news.osu.edu/tradition-evolved-ohio-state-announces-new-game-day-experiences/","source_title":"Tradition evolved: Ohio State announces new game day experiences","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-08-05","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Played during home football games; event admission policies apply.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-victory-bell","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Victory Bell","title":"Victory Bell","subtitle":"Ohio Stadium southeast tower","notes":"Look toward the southeast tower on game day and listen for the bell’s role in Ohio State’s victory and pregame ceremonies.","short_summary":"A stadium bell rung by Alpha Phi Omega after Buckeye victories.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State University Libraries documents that Alpha Phi Omega members ring the Victory Bell after Buckeye victories, a tradition begun in 1954.","source_url":"https://library.osu.edu/archives/faq","source_title":"Historic Ohio State: FAQ","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The bell is in Ohio Stadium; viewing and event access depend on stadium operations.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-block-o-card-stunts","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Block O Card Stunts","title":"Block O Card Stunts","subtitle":"Ohio Stadium student-section display","notes":"Watch the designated student section transform placards into coordinated images during a football game, without blocking nearby sightlines.","short_summary":"A coordinated visual tradition led by Ohio State’s official student cheering section.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State Alumni Magazine states that Block O was founded in 1938 and that its card stunts remain a major part of the organization.","source_url":"https://alumnimagazine.osu.edu/story/block-o-society","source_title":"He wants you to know: Your Block O days can live on","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-12-06","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visible during athletics events; participation and seating are governed by the event and student-section policies.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-buckeye-grove","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Buckeye Grove","title":"Buckeye Grove","subtitle":"Ohio Stadium memorial grove","notes":"Walk through the grove from public paths and read the individual tree markers honoring Ohio State football All-Americans.","short_summary":"A grove where a buckeye tree commemorates each honored football All-American.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State’s University Archives describes Buckeye Grove as the site where each Ohio State football All-American is honored with a buckeye tree.","source_url":"https://library.osu.edu/documents/university-archives/subject_files/homecoming_1.pdf","source_title":"Homecoming Queens and Kings","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor campus landmark; remain on public paths and respect plantings and memorial markers.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"osu-homecoming-parade","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Ohio State Homecoming Parade","title":"Homecoming Parade","subtitle":"Annual Homecoming Week event","notes":"Check the annual Homecoming page for the route and step-off time, then watch the floats, banners, and campus groups from public viewing areas.","short_summary":"An annual parade that brings student organizations, floats, and the wider Ohio State community together.","evidence_claim":"Ohio State Homecoming calls the parade one of the university’s longest-running traditions and states that it has been annual since 1965.","source_url":"https://homecoming.osu.edu/history","source_title":"History | Homecoming","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual event; consult the current Homecoming schedule for date, route, and any street closures.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
